{"ranking": ["M5", "M6", "M1"], "fault": "M5 (the output source follower) has the wrong gate connection. Its gate is tied to ibias (about 0.78 V) instead of node 'a', the drain of the M1 gain stage. This breaks the feedback loop through Rf. Vout and iin are pulled down to about 0.08 V, so M1 is cut off and M2 sits at Vds=0. The result is the collapse in gain, bandwidth and noise performance and the low output DC level."}
